  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 201.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 201.02 Applicability. The rules in this chapter shall apply to all procedures undertaken pursuant to RSA 485 and the NH drinking water rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 200) #10607, eff 6-1-14",
